# Unit24
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit24核心词汇

ignorant/ˈɪɡnərənt/无知的/He is ignorant of the basic rules.
illustrate/ˈɪləstreɪt/说明/The teacher used a chart to illustrate.
implement/ˈɪmplɪment/实施/The government will implement the policy.
implication/ˌɪmplɪˈkeɪʃn/含义/What are the implications of this decision?
implicit/ɪmˈplɪsɪt/含蓄的/There was an implicit agreement.
impulse/ˈɪmpʌls/冲动/He bought the car on impulse.
incline/ɪnˈklaɪn/倾斜；倾向/I am inclined to agree with you.
incorporate/ɪnˈkɔːrpəreɪt/包含/The design incorporates improvements.
inevitable/ɪnˈevɪtəbl/不可避免的/Change is inevitable.
infant/ˈɪnfənt/婴儿/The infant is only three months old.
inflation/ɪnˈfleɪʃn/通货膨胀/Inflation has been rising steadily.
ingredient/ɪnˈɡriːdiənt/成分/Fresh ingredients make food taste better.
inhabit/ɪnˈhæbɪt/居住/Many species inhabit this forest.
inherit/ɪnˈherɪt/继承/She inherited a large fortune.
initiative/ɪˈnɪʃətɪv/倡议/The government launched a new initiative.
innovation/ˌɪnəˈveɪʃn/创新/Innovation is the key to success.
insert/ɪnˈsɜːrt/插入/Please insert your card.
insight/ˈɪnsaɪt/洞察力/She has great insight into human behavior.
integral/ˈɪntɪɡrəl/必不可少的/Teamwork is integral to success.
integrate/ˈɪntɪɡreɪt/整合/We need to integrate technology into education.
intellectual/ˌɪntəˈlektʃuəl/知识分子的/He is an intellectual.
intelligence/ɪnˈtelɪdʒəns/智力/AI is changing our lives.
intense/ɪnˈtens/强烈的/The competition is very intense.
intention/ɪnˈtenʃn/意图/He had no intention of leaving.
interact/ˌɪntərˈækt/互动/Children learn by interacting.
intervene/ˌɪntərˈviːn/干预/The government intervened.
intimate/ˈɪntɪmət/亲密的/They are intimate friends.
investigate/ɪnˈvestɪɡeɪt/调查/The police are investigating.
investment/ɪnˈvestmənt/投资/Real estate is a safe investment.
isolate/ˈaɪsəleɪt/隔离/The patient was isolated.
judgment/ˈdʒʌdʒmənt/判断/He showed good judgment.
justification/ˌdʒʌstɪfɪˈkeɪʃn/正当理由/There is no justification for such behavior.
label/ˈleɪbl/标签/Read the label carefully.
labor/ˈleɪbər/劳动力/Labor costs have increased.
landscape/ˈlændskeɪp/风景/The landscape is beautiful.
launch/lɔːntʃ/发射；发起/The company launched a new product.
legislation/ˌledʒɪsˈleɪʃn/立法/The government passed new legislation.
legitimate/lɪˈdʒɪtɪmət/合法的/His concerns are legitimate.
likewise/ˈlaɪkwaɪz/同样地/She is talented; likewise, she is hardworking.
literally/ˈlɪtərəli/字面上/He literally ran all the way home.
literary/ˈlɪtəreri/文学的/She has a great interest in literary works.
logic/ˈlɑːdʒɪk/逻辑/His argument is based on sound logic.
mainstream/ˈmeɪnstriːm/主流/This has become a mainstream view.
manipulate/məˈnɪpjuleɪt/操纵/He tried to manipulate the situation.
manufacture/ˌmænjuˈfæktʃər/制造/The factory manufactures products.
mechanism/ˈmekənɪzəm/机制/The government introduced a new mechanism.
mediate/ˈmiːdieɪt/调解/She mediated between the two parties.
migrate/maɪˈɡreɪt/迁移/Many birds migrate south in winter.
modify/ˈmɑːdɪfaɪ/修改/We need to modify the plan.
moreover/mɔːrˈoʊvər/此外/The plan is impractical; moreover, it is expensive.
